WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.400
Food safety under control, with clear daily work and less paperwork.

00:05.400 --> 00:10.800
Bring the work your team needs into one clear workspace.

00:10.800 --> 00:16.200
Run each shift through visible opening, monitoring and closing routines.

00:16.200 --> 00:21.600
Keep temperature targets, exceptions and corrective actions connected to each reading.

00:21.600 --> 00:27.000
Record problems, corrective actions and manager sign-off in the daily diary.

00:27.000 --> 00:32.400
Prepare a focused, read-only inspection view for the selected period and records.

00:32.400 --> 00:38.400
Haccora. Safe. Clean. Traceable. Structured for food businesses in the United Kingdom. Official guidance and your business-specific procedures remain authoritative.
